  "limitations": [
    "Whole-SoC estimates including background activity, not app-attributed energy.",
    "Short idle window (10s). Boundary margin removes at least 2s; integrated energy covers only selected samples.",
    "CoreML fp16 vs llama Q8_0; image resize hashes differ. Not a pure same-weight runtime comparison.",
    "Full process windows include prepare, 3x232 scalar operations, batch queries, serialization and teardown. Native uses sequence packing for batch; CoreML uses scalar public API.",
    "Cache-present fresh processes, not erased OS/model compile caches. All three runs are serial, in order GPU, ANE, llama.",
    "CPU process seconds and GPU HW active residency are available; ANE utilization is not exposed by this OS.",
    "Harnesses differ (XCTest vs standalone), memory includes baseline; one pass per configuration. No statistical energy significance claim."
